  "help.precautionsBody": "Forgotten password = data cannot be recovered. This is by design — there is no backdoor, and no one, including the developer, can help restore it.\n\nPasskey is bound to this specific device. It won't work on a different device — you'll need the password or recovery key there instead.\n\nThe recovery key is shown only once. Once you close that screen, it can never be shown again — be sure to copy, save, or write it down immediately.\n\n\"Permanently Delete\" in the Encrypted Items list truly destroys the encrypted content — it does not just remove it from the list — and this action cannot be undone."
